tion in patients requiring urgent surgery; and Alentis Therapeutics AG to develop and commercialise lixudebart for rare kidney and liver diseases. The company was formerly known as Commonwealth Serum Laboratories Limited and later changed its name to CSL Limited in October 1991. CSL Limited was founded in 1916 and is headquartered in Melbourne, Australia.","fullTimeEmployees":29000,"city":"Melbourne","country":"Australia","website":"https://www.csl.com","industry":"Biotechnology","sector":"Healthcare"},"news":[],"info_date":"2026-10-31"}